<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Achei Barato - Grupo Oficial de Ofertas</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-gold: #FFCC00;
            --secondary-gold: #FFA500;
            --red-alert: #E50914;
            --green-whatsapp: #25D366;
            --blue-telegram: #0088cc;
            --bg-dark: #0b0d12;
            --card-bg: #151922;
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #a0a6b5;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 15px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .alert-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #E50914, #FF5252);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4);
            animation: pulseBanner 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulseBanner {
            0% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }
            100% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }
        }

        .profile-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 140px;
            height: 140px;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
        }

        .profile-img-fallback {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 3px solid var(--primary-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.4);
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .badge-official {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -8px;
            right: 50%;
            transform: translateX(50%);
            background: var(--primary-gold);
            color: #000;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF, var(--primary-gold));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--primary-gold);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .description {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .timer-card {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .timer-title {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #FF5252;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .countdown {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .time-box {
            background: #0d0e12;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            min-width: 60px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .time-box span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--primary-gold);
        }

        .time-box label {
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .capacity-bar-container {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .capacity-text {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .capacity-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 10px;
            background: #202530;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .capacity-fill {
            height: 100%;
            width: 94%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #25D366, var(--primary-gold), #FF5252);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .btn-whatsapp {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #25D366, #128C7E);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-telegram {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0088cc, #005580);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 136, 204, 0.4);
        }

        .footer-note {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="alert-banner">
            GRUPO OFICIAL DE OFERTAS & CUPONS
        </div>

        <div class="profile-container">
            <div class="profile-img-fallback">
                <svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFCC00" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path>
                    <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
                    <path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path>
                </svg>
                <span style="color:#FFCC00; font-weight:900; font-size:0.7rem; margin-top:4px;">ACHEI BARATO</span>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-official">OFICIAL</div>
        </div>

        <h1>ACHEI BARATO</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">DESCONTOS IMPERDIVEIS!</div>

        <p class="description">
            Receba em primeira mao promocoes exclusivas, erros de preco e cupons secretos das maiores lojas do Brasil!
        </p>

        <div class="timer-card">
            <div class="timer-title">O LINK DE ACESSO EXPIRA EM:</div>
            <div class="countdown">
                <div class="time-box">
                    <span id="hours">00</span>
                    <label>Horas</label>
                </div>
                <div class="time-box">
                    <span id="minutes">14</span>
                    <label>Minutos</label>
                </div>
                <div class="time-box">
                    <span id="seconds">59</span>
                    <label>Segundos</label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="capacity-bar-container">
            <div class="capacity-text">
                <span>Capacidade do Grupo</span>
                <span style="color: var(--primary-gold); font-weight: bold;">94% Ocupado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="capacity-bar">
                <div class="capacity-fill"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/Ju5Qk3FtdwcBVqqUU1a8oZ?s=cl&p=i&mlu=4&ilr=4" class="btn btn-whatsapp" target="_blank">
            ENTRAR NO WHATSAPP
        </a>

        <a href="https://t.me/AcheiBaratoo" class="btn btn-telegram" target="_blank">
            ENTRAR NO TELEGRAM
        </a>

        <div class="footer-note">
            *Entrada 100% Gratuita. Vagas Limitadas.
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        let totalSeconds = 15 * 60;
        function updateTimer() {
            let m = Math.floor(totalSeconds / 60);
            let s = totalSeconds % 60;
            document.getElementById('minutes').innerText = m < 10 ? '0' + m : m;
            document.getElementById('seconds').innerText = s < 10 ? '0' + s : s;
            if (totalSeconds > 0) totalSeconds--;
        }
        setInterval(updateTimer, 1000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
